	(label "GND" (at 36.83 212.09 180) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify right bottom)) (uuid "460f03ca-3371-594f-a9d5-14ef17e26ca5"))
	(label "USB_DM" (at 62.23 207.01 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "6bff5a92-c5ba-5b5e-9192-1ede5febbaf2"))
	(label "USB_DP" (at 62.23 209.55 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "16716951-f461-528b-9efe-849aa53cb3aa"))
	(label "+3V3" (at 62.23 212.09 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "fee20ba5-b374-582f-8ecb-d19f238fbbfd"))
	(text "Notes" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25 330.00 0) (effects (font (size 2 2) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "18fb9808-4d85-50c7-8319-89f60e8206bf"))
	(text "1. Charger: any USB-C PD charger of 30 W or more (15 V is mandatory above 27 W)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25 335.50 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "d50b6ba9-8964-57b6-88d4-9e90897e652c"))
	(text "2. U1 can also be a CH224K: then R1 = 1k (1206), R16 = 10k, same 56k on CFG1." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25 341.00 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "bee618f9-391e-5da0-9f11-2dab36daca8f"))
	(text "3. Fan PWM is open-collector through Q3, so the firmware output is inverted." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25 346.50 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "1a68ee61-e858-58c6-a96f-89320f4b0888"))
	(text "4. FAN_EN low or floating keeps the 12 V rail off (R6 pull-down)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25 352.00 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "7a53fd54-29f9-5a0f-911f-7fa163125aa8"))
	(text "5. PD_PG is open drain: enable the MCU's internal pull-up in firmware." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25 357.50 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "649b793f-89f7-5348-99f7-205e8d31bc8c"))
	(text "6. Tach inputs: 10k pull-up to 3V3 and 10k series resistor (protects against fans that pull tach to 12 V)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25 363.00 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "4e2d8860-0692-5d91-9138-fa5f90f280db"))
	(text "7. J2, J3 (and J4, J5 if used) are hand-soldered through-hole headers." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25 368.50 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "b4990f42-6897-5788-9fe5-b9b2bc6d090d"))
	(text "8. USB: the board's USB-C port carries data to the module's USB Serial/JTAG (flash and logs)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25 374.00 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "923dcf97-d12d-5984-b475-9e1bbed830d9"))
